## Model card

- **Name:** QoDuck (stealth model — official lineage undisclosed by Alibaba Cloud)
- **Short description:** An unannounced agentic coding LLM deployed by Alibaba Cloud inside its Qoder development platform (first surfaced 2026-11-07) as an in-the-wild canary/eval release. Tokenizer fingerprint matches the Qwen family. Qoder-exclusive: not on Hugging Face, no public REST API, no CLI.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud / Qoder International desktop app only; model-picker entry "QoDuck", upstream gateway key `lmodel`; individual tiers Free / Pro Trial / Lite / Pro / Pro+ / Ultra (Teams & Enterprise excluded). No standalone API or open weights.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-11-07 (promotional stealth preview); knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `opencode/qoduck`; upstream routing key `lmodel`. No public API ID outside the Qoder client.
- **Context window:** Up to 1,000,000 tokens (1M) — confirmed via Qoder client catalog data; no long-context retrieval benchmark (MRCR/RULER) published.
- **Modalities:** Text + code in/out; reasoning yes (adjustable "Thinking Intensity" → backend `parameters.reasoning_effort`, max level covered by the promo); tool calls yes (autonomous shell/file-execution loop). Multimodal image input "observed" by community testing but NOT officially confirmed by the vendor.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-09):** Promotional daily free allowance at 0.0× Credits (resets every 24h, covers even max thinking intensity); beyond the allowance, 0.5× Credit multiplier (same tier as Qwen 3.8 Max). Credit-based, not per-token USD; promo end date "yet to be determined."
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed. Community hypotheses: dense ~27B, or sparse MoE with Multi-Token-Prediction heads (throughput up to ~480 tok/s claimed). Neither confirmed by Alibaba. Proprietary hosted preview (no weights published).

